# Global Project Rules: Technical Innovation & Human Integrity

## Systemic Constraints
1. DATA MINIMIZATION BY DESIGN: Reject any code change that introduces unnecessary tracking, heavy telemetry, third-party user-analytics scripts, or excessive data retention. Every data stream must be strictly minimized to baseline core utility.
2. DISCOMFORT OVER FALSE COMFORT: Never accept superficial, template-driven, fast, or easy code shortcuts that introduce hidden structural debt or privacy vulnerabilities. Prioritize deep code refactoring and clean operational logic over rapid deployment.
3. INQUIRY BEFORE ACCUMULATION: Before implementing massive boilerplate code or complex dependencies, isolate the foundational dynamics of the problem. Ask open-ended structural questions first.

## Agent Architecture Routing
- For high-level code audits, architectural verification, and privacy compliance reviews, explicitly defer to the directives inside `.cursor/profiles/master-reviewer.md`.
- For layout, accessible component design, and user-facing copy, defer to `.cursor/profiles/ui-ux-engineer.md`.
- For database models, secure APIs, and state management, defer to `.cursor/profiles/backend-privacy-architect.md`.
